  "prompt_components": {
    "subject_analysis": "A famous luxury fashion heiress mid-meltdown. She is red-faced, mouth open screaming, tears streaming down cheeks smudging mascara. She wears an expensive, rumpled designer cashmere tracksuit and has oversized sunglasses pushed atop messy blonde hair. One hand aggressively thrusts a passport into the air towards an unimpressed gate agent. A pile of logo-heavy Louis Vuitton luggage is next to her legs.",
    "the_chaos_factor": "A deserted airport terminal gate late at night. Behind her, massive LED departure screens are aggressively glitching with corrupted text, static, and flashing colors. A stony-faced airline employee stands behind a podium saying 'CLOSED'. A few curious travelers watch from a distance.",
    "lighting_tech": "Harsh direct on-camera strobe firing. The flash creates hot spots on her sweaty forehead and the plastic passport page, mixing uglily with the cold blue/green ambient terminal fluorescents and the flickering light from the glitching screens.",
    "camera_gear": "Canon 1D X Mark III paired with a 70-200mm f/2.8L lens, zoomed to approx 135mm for compression from behind the barrier rope.",
    "imperfections_and_artifacts": "High ISO color noise (ISO 12800). Motion blur on the gesturing hand holding the passport. Color banding and scan lines visible on the glitching background screens due to shutter speed sync issues. Gritty, unretouched aesthetic.",
    "meta_tokens": "Candid street style, press photo realism, tabloid aesthetic, airport meltdown, viral moment, raw dng, grainy, unretouched, flash photography, public freakout."
  },
  "full_prompt_string": "Raw paparazzi photograph, telephoto lens compression, Canon 1D X Mark III, 70-200mm f/2.8. A luxury fashion heiress is screaming, tears welling, arguing with airport staff at a closed gate late at night. Passport raised aggressively mid-gesture. Rumpled designer tracksuit, messy hair, smudged mascara. Harsh direct on-camera flash mixed with ambient terminal light. Behind her, massive departure screens are glitching with corrupted static and text. High ISO grain, motion blur on hand, color banding from screens, gritty tabloid aesthetic, unretouched."
}

