    "lighting_tech": "Direct on-camera flash blasting the subject at close proximity, generating flat, unforgiving illumination with hard edge shadows falling directly behind her. Overexposed hotspots on skin and satin dress. Mixed Kelvin scene: cool, bluish flash dominating foreground while warm tungsten, neon reds from premiere signage, and ambient sodium vapor lights contaminate the background. Reflective car paint kicking specular flares into the lens.",
    "camera_gear": "Canon 1D X Mark III with a 24-70mm f/2.8L lens at ~35mm, on-camera Speedlite 600EX-RT firing full power in burst mode.",
    "imperfections_and_artifacts": "High ISO grain (ISO 6400+), slight motion blur from her stepping out and photographers bumping the shooter, marginal back-focus due to chaotic conditions, lens flare ghosts from headlights, chromatic aberration around high-contrast edges, rolling shutter skew from quick repositioning, clipped highlights from flash burn.",
